// Fixtures for the worksheet's pure modules, generated from the backend so
// the two arithmetic engines and the two layout readers cannot drift:
//
//   cd /opt/qcbackend-src && .venv/bin/python <dump script>
//   (bss.describe / pfs_schema.describe, sheet_layout.layout(...) with the
//    index maps dropped and default-valued cell fields omitted,
//    sheet_layout.flatten(...) for the flat values, and bss.pl_totals /
//    bss.bs_totals / pfs_schema.totals / sheet_layout.debt_totals for the
//    expected figures, Decimals as floats).
//
// The P&L and balance-sheet cases are the bodies `app/tests/test_business_statements.py`
// asserts on, plus a messy-money case. A `.test.ts` name keeps this inside the
// tests' file set; the one test below pins what the data claims to be.

